      "source": "Extension of <a href=\"PersistentPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyAccessor</code></a> that is also able to obtain and set values for\n<a href=\"PersistentPropertyPath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyPath</code></a>s.",
