      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the value pointed to by the given <a href=\"PersistentPropertyPath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyPath</code></a>. If the given path is empty, the wrapped\nbean is returned. On each path segment value lookup, the resulting value is post-processed depending on the given\n<a href=\"AccessOptions.GetOptions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>AccessOptions.GetOptions</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回给定 <a href=\"PersistentPropertyPath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyPath</code></a> 所指向的值。如果给定的路径为空，则返回包装的 bean。在每次路径段值查找时，根据给定的 <a href=\"AccessOptions.GetOptions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>AccessOptions.GetOptions</code></a> 对结果进行后处理。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
